#. module: diy_workshops
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:diy_workshops.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If you want to go further, manage your workshop materials with the Inventory "
"app. Track stock levels in real time, automate restocking, and monitor "
"supplies to avoid shortages; ensuring your DIY projects always have the "
"materials they need."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດການຢ່າງລະອຽດຂຶ້ນ, ໃຫ້ຄຸ້ມຄອງອຸປະກອນເວີກຊັອບດ້ວຍແອັບສາງສິນຄ້າ. "
"ກວດສອບຈຳນວນສະຕັອກແບບທັນທີ, ສັ່ງຊື້ເຕີມສະຕັອກອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແລະ "
"ຕິດຕາມອຸປະກອນເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຂາດແຄນ; ຮັບປະກັນວ່າໂຄງການ DIY ຂອງທ່ານມີອຸປະກອນພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ສະເໝີ."

#. module: diy_workshops
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:diy_workshops.view_page_the_studio
msgid ""
"In a quiet cabin surrounded by nature, we bring people together to explore, "
"learn, and make with their hands. From <span class=\"o_text_highlight "
"o_text_highlight_wavy\" style=\"--text-highlight-color: var(--o-color-5); --"
"text-highlight-width: 2px;\">sewing</span> to <span class=\"o_text_highlight "
"o_text_highlight_wavy\" style=\"--text-highlight-color: var(--o-color-5); --"
"text-highlight-width: 2px;\">woodworking</span> and <span "
"class=\"o_text_highlight o_text_highlight_wavy\" style=\"--text-highlight-"
"color: var(--o-color-5); --text-highlight-width: 2px;\">ceramics</span>, the "
"studio is a welcoming space where ideas become real."
msgstr ""
"ໃນເຮືອນໄມ້ອັນງຽບສະຫງົບທີ່ອ້ອມຮອບດ້ວຍທຳມະຊາດ, ພວກເຮົາພາທຸກຄົນມາພົບປະກັນເພື່ອສຳຫຼວດ, ຮຽນຮູ້, ແລະ "
"ສ້າງສັນດ້ວຍມື. ຕັ້ງແຕ່ <span class=\"o_text_highlight o_text_highlight_wavy\" "
"style=\"--text-highlight-color: var(--o-color-5); --text-highlight-width: "
"2px;\">ການຫຍິບຜ້າ</span> ໄປຈົນເຖິງ <span class=\"o_text_highlight "
"o_text_highlight_wavy\" style=\"--text-highlight-color: var(--o-color-5); --"
"text-highlight-width: 2px;\">ງານໄມ້</span> ແລະ <span class=\"o_text_highlight "
"o_text_highlight_wavy\" style=\"--text-highlight-color: var(--o-color-5); --"
"text-highlight-width: 2px;\">ເຄື່ອງປັ້ນດິນເຜົາ</span>, "
"ສະຕູດິໂອແຫ່ງນີ້ຄືພື້ນທີ່ອັນອົບອຸ່ນທີ່ປ່ຽນແນວຄິດໃຫ້ກາຍເປັນຈິງ."

#. module: diy_workshops
#: model_terms:event.event,description:diy_workshops.event_event_3
msgid "Joe - YouCraft"
msgstr "ໂຈ - YouCraft"

#. module: diy_workshops
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:diy_workshops.view_page_the_studio
msgid ""
"Joe bridges the gap between the natural forest and the handcraft workshop. A "
"skilled woodworker with a deep reverence for reclaimed timber, he brings "
"precision and structural design to every project. When he’s not at the "
"workbench, Joe draws on his deep knowledge of foraging and botany, blending "
"ancient woodworking traditions with a passion for sustainable, nature-led "
"living."
msgstr ""
"ໂຈ ຄືຜູ້ເຊື່ອມໂຍງລະຫວ່າງປ່າທຳມະຊາດ ແລະ ໂຮງງານຫັດຖະກຳ. "
"ຊ່າງໄມ້ຜູ້ຊຳນານງານທີ່ເຫັນຄຸນຄ່າຂອງໄມ້ເກົ່າ, ລາວນຳເອົາຄວາມລະອຽດຊັດເຈນ ແລະ "
"ການອອກແບບໂຄງສ້າງມາສູ່ທຸກໆຜົນງານ. ເມື່ອບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໜ້າໂຕະເຮັດວຽກ, ໂຈ "
"ຍັງໃຊ້ຄວາມຮູ້ເລິກເຊິ່ງກ່ຽວກັບພືດພັນທຳມະຊາດ, ປະສານຮວມວິຊາຊີບໄມ້ບູຮານເຂົ້າກັບວິຖີຊີວິດທີ່ຍືນຍົງ ແລະ "
"ອີງອາໄສທຳມະຊາດ."

